---
description: Frontend layout — orientation classes, DOM-specific SCSS, table aspect ratios.
globs: frontend/**/*.{tsx,scss}
alwaysApply: false
---

- `app-container` has `is-portrait` or `is-landscape` (see `App.tsx`).
- Orientation-specific layout: nest `.is-portrait &` / `.is-landscape &` under the component root; match real DOM (see `sass-file-organisation.mdc`).
- `Comp` (and similar): JSX structure can differ by orientation — don’t assume the same wrapper tree.
- Pool table: portrait `1/2`, landscape `2/1` on `view-container` / table styles.
